  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of Health Conditions in Honduras</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejoramiento del Nivel de Salud en Honduras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">La operacin espera contribuir a una reduccin de los indicadores de desnutricin y mortalidad materno-infantil que vayan alineados a las metas intermedias y finales de la ERP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to reduce maternal and infant mortality and malnutrition, which is a goal of both the country&apos;s poverty reduction strategy and the UN Millenium Development Goals. The project contains service delivery elements and support for strengthening primary care services in areas that are direct causes of malnutrition and mortality.</narrative>
  </description>
